Zapp Android Wallet: Licensing
==============================

The work as a whole, as conveyed in either binary or source form, is licensed
under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only (AGPL-3.0-only).
The full text is in LICENSE-AGPL.

    SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only

This is version 3 ONLY. No "or any later version" option is offered anywhere in
this project, because the license that compels it does not offer one.


Why the whole work is AGPL
--------------------------

The application links the ZODL Slipstream sync engine, which Znewco, Inc.
(d/b/a Zcash Open Development Lab) licenses under AGPL-3.0-only. Slipstream is
statically linked into the native library `libzcashwalletsdk.so` that ships
inside the APK, and the application calls into it over JNI in its own process.
That makes the application and Slipstream a single combined work rather than an
aggregation of separate programs, so section 5 of the AGPL requires the entire
combined work to be conveyed under the AGPL to every recipient.


What this covers
----------------

The AGPL statement above covers the Zapp Android application: every Gradle module
in this repository and the binaries built from them.

It does not cover third-party code that is vendored or bundled here and carries
its own license. In particular, the blind-push relay server under
`docs/notifications/deployment/blind-push/` is vendored verbatim from
zappMessaging (Apache-2.0), is a separate program from the application, and
remains under Apache-2.0. See docs/Third party licenses.md.


Upstream code
-------------

Zapp is a fork of Zodl (https://github.com/zodl-inc/zodl-android), which is
itself a fork of Zashi
(https://github.com/Electric-Coin-Company/zashi-android).

Upstream's own code remains under the MIT License and retains the upstream
copyright notice (Copyright (c) 2021-2025 Zcash). That grant belongs to
upstream and nothing here affects it. See LICENSE-MIT. The MIT License permits
sublicensing, which is what allows upstream code to be conveyed as part of this
AGPL-licensed combined work.

Modifications made by the Zapp Contributors, including modifications to files
inherited from upstream, are licensed AGPL-3.0-only. To obtain upstream code
under MIT alone, take it from the upstream projects rather than from this
repository.


Previously published versions
-----------------------------

Versions of this project published before this change were released under the
MIT License, with Zapp-original contributions additionally offered under
`MIT OR Apache-2.0`. Those grants were made and are not being withdrawn.
Anyone who already received a copy under those terms keeps those terms for that
copy. This change applies to this version and to versions published after it,
which are conveyed under AGPL-3.0-only.

LICENSE-APACHE is retained for that reason, and because bundled third-party
dependencies are themselves licensed under Apache-2.0.


